<title>FRANCE: Latest details of EU grain export/import balance.</title>
<headline>Latest details of EU grain export/import balance.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are details of EU grain export/import commitments as of November 26 in the July-June 1996/97 campaign, supplied by member country officials.</p>
<p>On November 28, the EU additionally granted exports of 198,900 tonnes of soft wheat, 99,385 tonnes of barley, 35,692 tonnes of rye and 20,500 tonnes of oats</p>
<p>Figures ('000 tonnes) are based on officially communicated certificates and are subject to revision.</p>
<p>			 ---------1996/97-------  ------1995/96-----</p>
<p>			     1Jul96 to 26 Nov96     1Jul95 to 26Nov95</p>
<p>			 EXPORTS  PCT(1) IMPORTS  EXPORTS    IMPORTS</p>
<p>  Soft wheat(grain)  3,625	92     390    3,947	  861</p>
<p>  Flour (2)	    2,848     104	 9    2,735	   10</p>
<p>Food aid</p>
<p>    - grain		236	68	 0	346	    0</p>
<p>    - flour (2)	   36	42	 0	 86	    0</p>
