<p>    - grain		  0		   -	245	    -</p>
<p>    - flour (2)	    9		   0	 43	    0</p>
<p> TOTAL SOFT WHEAT    6,754	91     399    7,402	  871</p>
<p>  Durum (grain)	   42		 151	 16	  644</p>
<p>  Semolina (3)	   237     846	 0	 28	    0</p>
<p>  Food aid		   1		   0	 41	    0</p>
<p> TOTAL DURUM WHEAT     280     329     151	 85	  644</p>
<p> ALL WHEAT	     7,034	94     550    7,487	1,515</p>
<p>  Barley (grain)     2,685     236	16    1,137	   76</p>
<p>  Malt (4)	     1,762	87	 0    2,153	    0</p>
<p>  Donations		  0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL BARLEY	  4,447     135	16    3,290	   76</p>
<p>  Maize (grain)	   36    1800     207	  2	1,048</p>
<p>  Food aid		   0		   -	 11	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL MAIZE		36     277     207	 13	1,048</p>
<p>  Rye (grain)	    554	55	 3	990	    7</p>
